│                          │ diameter-packing objective. The optimizer works directly with all pairwise squared        │
│                          │ distances: close pairs are repelled while the currently largest pairs are pulled inward.  │
│                          │ After every step the configuration is centered and uniformly normalized, which is valid   │
│                          │ because the target ratio is scale and translation invariant.                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The smooth soft-min/soft-max force is annealed from a broad pair-distance objective to a  │
│                          │ sharp approximation of the actual minimum/maximum objective. Multiple fixed-seed          │
│                          │ restarts, including a cube-plus-octahedron structured seed, make the result reproducible  │
│                          │ and substantially stronger than a single Gaussian sample. The exact unsmoothed ratio is   │
│                          │ evaluated throughout and the best 14-point configuration is returned.                     │
