│ patch_description        │ Exploit the strong likelihood that the best diameter packing is antipodal, since          │
│                          │ antipodal spherical codes naturally fix the diameter while distributing nearest-neighbor  │
│                          │ contacts uniformly. Replace unconstrained random starts with exact antipodal starts. Also │
│                          │ reallocate the optimization budget using a short, diverse screening continuation followed │
│                          │ by substantially sharper refinement only for the best survivors. This retains basin       │
│                          │ diversity while allowing the promising contact graphs to converge under higher            │
│                          │ soft-min/soft-max sharpness, rather than spending the full budget on clearly inferior     │
│                          │ starts.                                                                                   │
