│ patch_description        │ The best prior result used only translation and global-scale normalization rather than    │
│                          │ constraining every point to the unit sphere. A diameter-packing optimum is not generally  │
│                          │ cospherical, so the per-point projection removes useful radial degrees of freedom. This   │
│                          │ edit changes the existing normalization helper to center the configuration and fix only   │
│                          │ its RMS radius, while changing momentum/gradient projection to remove just translation    │
│                          │ and global scaling. The cube-axis seed is also rescaled so its axis vertices initially    │
│                          │ lie on the same radius as cube vertices.                                                  │
