│ patch_description        │ Add a final deterministic constrained optimization phase using the exact packing          │
│                          │ formulation: maximize a common squared separation lower bound `r` subject to every        │
│                          │ pairwise squared distance lying in ``. The existing stochastic/contact-graph search is    │
│                          │ retained for global basin discovery, while SLSQP receives its best result as a            │
│                          │ high-quality feasible warm start. Anchoring one point at the origin removes translational │
│                          │ degeneracy, and scaling the incumbent diameter to one makes the constraint system         │
│                          │ directly match the evaluator objective. Analytic constraint Jacobians make this polishing │
│                          │ phase substantially more reliable and faster than finite-difference constrained           │
│                          │ optimization.                                                                             │
