│ patch_name               │ antipodal_linecode_polish                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ This construction reframes the 14-point diameter packing as a 7-line packing problem:     │
│                          │ each optimized unit direction is returned together with its antipode. Antipodal pairs     │
│                          │ automatically set the diameter to 2, while the minimum distance is controlled solely by   │
│                          │ the largest absolute inner product between distinct lines.                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The algorithm first performs deterministic projected repulsion on the sphere using        │
│                          │ increasingly sharp power energies to discover balanced line-contact graphs. It then       │
│                          │ applies SLSQP to the direct minimax formulation, minimizing the maximum squared line      │
│                          │ correlation subject to unit-vector constraints. This directly targets the evaluator ratio │
│                          │ while avoiding arbitrary box constraints or a fragile fixed polyhedral construction.      │
