│                          │ configurations, followed by a diameter-normalized force-based feasibility annealing       │
│                          │ stage. The annealer repels the currently short distances while contracting long           │
│                          │ distances, allowing symmetry to break before exact optimization. The strongest diverse    │
│                          │ candidates are then polished with an active-set nonlinear diameter-packing formulation    │
│                          │ using SLSQP, maximizing the minimum squared separation subject to every squared distance  │
│                          │ being at most one. This combines global basin exploration with an exact constrained final │
│                          │ solve rather than relying primarily on one symmetric local start.                         │
