│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ exact_slsqp_polish                                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ Add a final constrained maximin polishing pass on the best multistart result. The         │
│                          │ existing smooth-force stages are effective at locating a strong contact graph, but they   │
│                          │ only approximate the nonsmooth ratio objective. This pass fixes the diameter to at most   │
│                          │ one and directly maximizes an auxiliary minimum squared-distance variable subject to      │
│                          │ every pairwise constraint \(t \leq d_{ij}^2 \leq 1\). It supplies analytic constraint     │
│                          │ Jacobians, avoids relying on finite differences, and retains the original point set       │
│                          │ whenever the constrained solver does not produce an exact-score improvement. The import   │
│                          │ is local with a fallback, preserving operation in environments without SciPy.             │
